744 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (In today's fast-paced technology world, Product Managers \(PMs\) are the navigators steering the ship through choppy waters, rife with shifting priorities and limited resources. PMs must make strategic decisions to ensure the product's success, and align their focus with the business and customer needs. This is where product prioritization frameworks come in. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [2]
>>
