/S /P
/ActualText (The Three Components of ICE)
/Pg 18 0 R
>>
endobj
835 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (1. Impact: Measured on a scale of 1 to 10, impact assesses how significantly the project will influence a targeted key metric.)
