910 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (AARRR is not just a catchy acronym; it's a robust framework that provides a structured approach to understanding and influencing customer behaviour. It helps product managers identify vital KPIs, thereby enabling them to make data-driven decisions for sustainable growth. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
911 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (AARRR allows startups and product managers to focus on metrics that genuinely matter, streamlining their strategies for acquisition, activation, retention, referral, and revenue. This targeted approach can significantly increase the likelihood of building a successful, sustainable business. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
912 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (A very important part of both interviews and case submissions are the metrics one chooses, and hence the following frameworks will help you to chart the accurate metrics. Each framework is used to serve a particular purpose - customer acquisition & revenue growth, user experience, etc.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
913 0 obj
<<
