/Pg 21 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
915 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The AARRR framework, popularly known as the "Pirate Metrics," offers startup founders and product managers a proven model to drive business growth. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
