/S /P
/ActualText (What is AARRR? )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
917 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (AARRR is an acronym that outlines the customer's journey in the digital landscape. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [18]
>>
endobj
918 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Acquisition: This refers to where your users come from, whether through search engines, social media, or other channels. Eg: SEO Performance like number of people clicked on your Facebook/Google ad to visit website  )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [19]
>>
endobj
919 0 obj
<<
