/T (Candidate:  I would like to create a value-effort matrix  to assess the prioritization of these products -  A smartwatch will provide the highest value since it will address all the concerns of parents and will not prove to be a bother for children to carry. So, high impact and medium effort. A mobile app requires a child to carry a smartphone and thus it will not address the need of parents to not give their child a smartphone. So, medium impact and low effort. A smartphone will address parents' concerns but will require more development, will be more expensive than a smartwatch, and will prove to be another item for children to carry. So, high impact, high effort. )
