/ActualText (Summarizing the critique, Splitwise excels in user-friendly expense management, offering a minimalistic UI with effective use of colors. Its flexible bill splitting options and group features simplify expense tracking. However, the lack of payment verification in "Settle Up" can lead to discrepancies. The app's innovative "Simplify Debts" feature minimizes transactions but could improve discoverability. Potential improvements include a less cluttered home page and the addition of features like payment integration with popular platforms and debt settlement reminders.)
