/S /P
/ActualText (Efficiency:)
/Pg 70 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
1959 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Seamless integration with other Google services, such as Gmail and Google Meet, made it convenient for users to create events and set up video conferences directly from the app. Users can share their calendars with others, enabling easy scheduling of group events or meetings. You can set permissions to control who can view, edit, or manage your calendar.)
/Pg 70 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
