/S /P
/ActualText (Innovation:)
/Pg 70 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
1961 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Few of the innovative features are that you can directly create events from Google Chat without leaving the chat and all the chat members will be added to the event as attendees. You can use Find a Time feature to schedule meetings and this smart feature would check the available slots of your attendees and suggest a suitable time. You can also leverage your Google Calendar and bookable appointment schedules for business purposes which requires payment.)
/Pg 70 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
1962 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Improvement:)
/Pg 70 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
1963 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (While the app was user-friendly for those familiar with calendar apps, new users might find it slightly complex, especially when dealing with advanced features like event scheduling with multiple attendees, bookable appointments which require payments, etc. Calendar app icon always shows 31, instead it can show the current date of the month. Google Calendar is not well integrated with a few non-Google productivity tools. A new feature can be added where we can drag and drop events between days and in order to reschedule it.)
/Pg 70 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
