endobj
2206 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Candidate: Great. I'll begin by analyzing the current landscape for home-cooked meal delivery services in India. Currently, there's a growing trend toward online food delivery platforms, including cooked meals. We have established players like Swiggy and Zomato, which offer a variety of restaurant food. However, there's a noticeable gap in the market for homemade, healthy, and customizable meals delivered to consumers' doorsteps. This presents an opportunity for Myntra to leverage its brand and platform.)
/Pg 83 0 R
