/ActualText (Competition Analysis - Hotstar is the market leader in sports OTT followed by Sony Liv. Hotstar has the rights to ISL \(Indian super league football\), Indian kabaddi league, and EPL \(English premier league football\). It had the IPL cricket rights and Formula 1 races. Now Jio Cinema is aggressively entering sports with winning bids for the FIFA world cup and IPL. Formula 1 governing body FIA has started its own streaming app.)
