/ActualText (Most trips probably take about 15 km. If you combine that with the car coming in and the time it takes to communicate, it should be around 30 minutes per trip. Therefore, we are talking 7 to 8 km and 2 trips per hour. Also, a  driver may not get a passenger every time you are done, so to be safe it should be about 1.5 trips per hour.)
