/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Finally, we need to add in a price for starting an Uber ride; otherwise people will try to do really short trips, which is bad for profit. On the other hand, that seems unfair to users who take long trips. A compromise would be to have a minimum ride cost, of say $5. This way, a driver in a more urban setting who ends up doing many short rides will maximize their earnings, but we can still offer great value to our passengers on long rides.)
/Pg 95 0 R
/K [16]
>>
