2561 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText ( Assuming we are a manufacturing company who wants to create smart IoT products that can be used in a restaurant in place of their traditional tables. Right now the restaurant industry majorly has traditional sitting arrangements focusing mostly on luxury and comfort rather than technical advancements. So, our product will give a new flavour by increasing the user engagement and also it will be a premium service that can attract new users.)
/Pg 99 0 R
/K [3]
>>
