/P 3538 0 R
/ActualText (A table with a private network facilitating all the services through a smartphone:)
/Pg 100 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
2603 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Every table will be equipped with a microchip which can be connected with the customer smartphone using their Wi-Fi, and it will take them to a private network where they can see the menu, order their food, check out the restaurant amenities, check information about our food and beverage services, watch movies which are pre downloaded into the private network and pay the bill at the end using their smartphones.)
/Pg 100 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
